+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; script-src-attr 'none'; style-src 'self'; style-src-attr 'none'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; worker-src 'none'; manifest-src 'none'; require-trusted-types-for 'script'; trusted-types 'none'">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container privacy-copy">
+    <h1>Your privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>This notice describes this static website. Browsing does not require an account or personal details.</p>
+    <h2>Only what is needed to show the page</h2>
+    <p>This website has no data collection forms, analytics, advertising trackers, fingerprinting, or client-side scripts. It does not set cookies or write personal information to browser storage. Your browser may cache public images and styles to load pages faster.</p>
+    <h2>No automatic requests to third parties</h2>
+    <p>Images and styles are served from this website. The coffee photograph is a locally hosted copy from Unsplash, so viewing it does not send a request to Unsplash. No external fonts, embedded media, or social SDKs load on these pages.</p>
+    <h2>Hosting and connection information</h2>
+    <p>To deliver a page, our hosting provider receives connection information such as your IP address, the requested URL, and browser request headers. Hosting logs and their retention depend on the deployment provider; this website does not add its own analytics or logging. Avoid putting personal details or secrets in URLs.</p>
+    <h2>Cookies, choices, and other services</h2>
+    <p>There are no optional trackers to accept or reject. Privacy protections apply to every visitor by default. You can remove cached site files in your browser settings.</p>
+    <p>Account, rewards, ordering, and contact services are not implemented in this static website. If those services are added, their data collection, retention, and access or deletion controls must be explained before personal information is requested.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><a href="/">Return to The Daily Grind</a></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
